WEBVTT

00:05:59.371 --> 00:06:02.079
into your skin ...

00:06:02.079 --> 00:06:03.454
from how tight --

00:06:03.454 --> 00:06:05.204
but you touch it, it’s like Braille,

00:06:05.204 --> 00:06:06.621
it’s like, “Help me!”

00:06:06.621 --> 00:06:09.496
(Laughter)

00:06:11.288 --> 00:06:13.996
I love seeing the women
that identify with that so much.

00:06:13.996 --> 00:06:15.079
(Laughter)

00:06:15.496 --> 00:06:16.663
But I love it even more

00:06:16.663 --> 00:06:20.413
when they’re sitting next to a woman
that has no idea what I’m talking about --

00:06:20.413 --> 00:06:21.413
(Laughter)

00:06:21.413 --> 00:06:23.663
because that woman always looks outraged.

00:06:23.663 --> 00:06:24.663
(Laughter)

00:06:24.663 --> 00:06:28.038
I was at a show once and this woman
was like, “That sounds awful.

00:06:28.746 --> 00:06:31.288
Why wouldn’t you just diet and exercise?”